    "FRONT VIEW: project the {0} points up to the base line and draw the cone in thin lines (height {1}, with each generator joined to the apex).": "VOORAANSIG: projekteer die {0} punte op na die basislyn en teken die keël in dun lyne (hoogte {1}, met elke beskrywer met die toppunt verbind).",
    "Project each cut point straight down into the top view onto ITS OWN generator (the radial line with the same number). Points {0} and {1} lie on the centre line; carry {2} and {3} across from the left view later if they are hard to place.": "Projekteer elke snypunt reguit af na die boaansig op SY EIE beskrywer (die radiale lyn met dieselfde nommer). Punte {0} en {1} lê op die middellyn; dra {2} en {3} later oor van die linkeraansig as hulle moeilik is om te plaas.",
    "Line in the SECTIONAL TOP VIEW: the base circle, and the cut face as a smooth curve through the {0} points. Hatch the cut face.": "Trek die GESNYDE BOAANSIG uit: die basissirkel, en die snyvlak as 'n gladde kromme deur die {0} punte. Arseer die snyvlak.",
    "Measure each point's distance from the centre line in the TOP view and mark it on both sides of the new centre line on its projector. Join the points with a smooth curve: an ellipse.": TS_CENTRE + ".",
